(text "PA0/PA1: active-high TIM2 heater drive. PB0/PB1/PB2/PB9: static DC GPIO only (never PWM).\nPA4..PA7: ADC IMON1..4. PB3/PB4/PB5/PC6: active-low DC faults.\nPA9: internal hub port 1 enable (3.3 V). Attach USB only while high; disable UCPD dead-battery pull-down.\nSHT40 at 0x44; keep physically away from power components. New firmware pin map is required." (at 25.4000 223.5200 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a15597e-8dbb-5253-9325-4dba3d9668e9"))
